  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is the foot of the perpendicular from&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> on the line <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0022519_Ans_1_xx.jpg\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 244px;\" /></strong></u><br /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>b</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>5</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a, b</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>2, 8</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>",
